 "panels": [
  {
   "id": 1,
   "type": "text",
   "title": "",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 5
   },
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "**Compare a selection** (BubbleUp-style). Narrow the spans with the **Where** and **and** filter bars (attribute names and values\nautocomplete from Tempo; one condition per bar) and break them down with **Group by**. Choose **Spans**, the **Y-axis** attribute and a band on it\n(**From** / **To**; duration takes units such as `500ms` or `2s`, other attributes plain numbers). The heatmap shows\nevery span over time as counts; the dot chart under it shows every span on its own (click one for its trace); the table lists each attribute value with how many of its spans are **in the band** and how many\nare **outside it**, sorted by the share in the band. Compare that share with the overall share on the right: a value well\nabove it is what the selection has in common. To narrow the selection in time, drag on the heatmap (the comparison\nthen covers that window only). For a box drawn freehand on a duration heatmap, use\n[Traces Drilldown](/a/grafana-exploretraces-app/explore) → Duration → select a region → Comparison."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "type": "heatmap",
   "title": "${y} over time: all ${spans:text}",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "tempo",
    "uid": "grafanacloud-traces"
   },
   "description": "TraceQL histogram_over_time: buckets are powers of two. The band you selected is From..To",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 5,
    "w": 18,
    "h": 10
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "tempo",
      "uid": "grafanacloud-traces"
     },
     "queryType": "traceql",
     "metricsQueryType": "range",
     "query": "{${spans} && resource.deployment.environment.name=\"otel-poc\"} | {${where}} | {${and}} | histogram_over_time(${y})"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "short"
    }
   },
   "options": {
    "calculate": false,
    "yAxis": {
